{"id": "THG-F20", "baselineId": "codex-26.1007.30912-c5b273322a83", "claim": "Yji pops the newest Ezn record before attempting restore. An empty list returns false; an unsupported kind is skipped recursively. It imports thread-panel-state, tries the original then opposite panel, caps the recorded index to the current tab count and requests start/after insertion with revealAndFocus=true, reason=closed-tab and isDisconnected returning false.", "sourcePath": "app.asar/webview/assets/app-initial-6350d04672d0.js", "sourceHash": "604b5d2de4fbb41f3d0dc5b3662129c558e1c7b8aac8cc87225286f58dcfaf8f", "locator": {"byteRange": {"start": 4634891, "endExclusive": 4635803}, "spanHash": "0624aa9fb40dcadab138c0ed04f383e72015a82bcde3d41cc2e685d110bcf1fe", "contractRef": {"path": "raw/tab-history-command-goals-v1/initial/source-contracts.json", "bytes": 4926077, "sha256": "71ccf3555dae3256c9630e0b22e0afe112642f591898f7e5ea4d395b1c39885d", "jsonPointer": "/selectedSourceUnits/19"}}, "sourceUnitId": "THG-SOURCE-017", "method": "frozen full-program AST and scoped declaration/reference review; no target code evaluation", "confidence": "confirmed", "verificationStatus": "static-source-only; runtime-not-observed"}
{"id": "THG-F21", "baselineId": "codex-26.1007.30912-c5b273322a83", "claim": "A truthy descriptor-restore result alone is insufficient: Yji also checks the saved tabId exists in that panel controller before requesting activation and returning true. If neither panel succeeds it recursively tries older records. A caught exception re-adds the record through YRn, reports the error and returns false.", "sourcePath": "app.asar/webview/assets/app-initial-6350d04672d0.js", "sourceHash": "604b5d2de4fbb41f3d0dc5b3662129c558e1c7b8aac8cc87225286f58dcfaf8f", "locator": {"byteRange": {"start": 4634891, "endExclusive": 4635803}, "spanHash": "0624aa9fb40dcadab138c0ed04f383e72015a82bcde3d41cc2e685d110bcf1fe", "contractRef": {"path": "raw/tab-history-command-goals-v1/initial/source-contracts.json", "bytes": 4926077, "sha256": "71ccf3555dae3256c9630e0b22e0afe112642f591898f7e5ea4d395b1c39885d", "jsonPointer": "/selectedSourceUnits/19"}}, "sourceUnitId": "THG-SOURCE-017", "method": "frozen full-program AST and scoped declaration/reference review; no target code evaluation", "confidence": "confirmed", "verificationStatus": "static-source-only; runtime-not-observed"}
